<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<article class="builder-card dining-card ${not empty card.image ? 'has-background' : ''}" data-card-kind="dining" data-card-key="${fn:escapeXml(card.key)}" data-saved-only="${card.savedOnly}" data-region-id="${card.regionId}">
<div class="card-front"><p class="card-kind"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3v6c0 3 6 3 6 0V3M7 3v18M20 21V3c-5 2-5 10 0 10"/></svg><c:out value="${empty card.category ? '음식점·카페' : card.category}"/></p>
<c:choose><c:when test="${not empty card.image}"><img class="card-background" src="${root}${fn:escapeXml(card.image.path)}" alt="${fn:escapeXml(card.image.alt)}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="${card.image.width}" height="${card.image.height}" draggable="false"></c:when><c:otherwise><div class="card-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 96 96"><c:choose><c:when test="${card.category eq '카페'}"><path d="M22 36h44v24a18 18 0 0 1-18 18H40a18 18 0 0 1-18-18ZM66 40h6a10 10 0 0 1 0 20h-6M16 84h62M34 14v10M48 10v14M62 14v10"/></c:when><c:otherwise><circle cx="48" cy="48" r="26"/><path d="M10 16v18c0 10 12 10 12 0V16M16 16v64M86 80V16c-12 8-12 32 0 32"/></c:otherwise></c:choose></svg></div></c:otherwise></c:choose>
<div class="card-overview"><h3><c:out value="${card.name}"/></h3><p><c:out value="${card.regionName}"/> · <c:out value="${card.designation}"/></p><p><c:out value="${card.locationDescription}"/></p></div>
<c:set var="cardDetails" value="공식 지정·방문 정보"/><%@ include file="card-actions.jspf" %></div>
<details class="card-back card-details"><summary>공식 지정·방문 정보</summary><div class="card-detail-content"><h4><c:out value="${card.name}"/></h4><p><c:out value="${card.locationDescription}"/></p>
<c:choose><c:when test="${card.savedOnly}"><p><c:out value="${card.description}"/></p></c:when><c:otherwise>
<dl><dt>공식 지정</dt><dd>시흥시 <c:out value="${card.designation}"/></dd><c:if test="${card.cuisine ne '미확인'}"><dt>업태</dt><dd><c:out value="${card.cuisine}"/></dd></c:if><c:if test="${card.designationNumber ne '미확인'}"><dt>지정번호 · 지정일</dt><dd><c:out value="${card.designationNumber}"/> · <c:out value="${card.designatedOn}"/></dd></c:if><dt>영업시간 · 가격 · 예약</dt><dd>미확인 · 방문 전 업소에 확인해 주세요.</dd><dt>자료 기준일</dt><dd><c:out value="${card.contentDate}"/></dd><dt>출처 확인일</dt><dd><c:out value="${card.checkedOn}"/> · 공식 목록 확인</dd></dl>
<p>공식 지정 목록을 바탕으로 소개합니다. 위생 지정은 맛 평가나 현재 영업 여부를 보장하지 않습니다.</p><a class="detail-link" href="${fn:escapeXml(card.sourceUrl)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><c:out value="${card.sourceTitle}"/> · 새 탭</a>
</c:otherwise></c:choose><c:if test="${not empty card.image}"><p class="photo-credit"><c:out value="${card.image.attribution}"/> · <c:set var="creditImage" value="${card.image}"/><c:set var="creditSourceLabel" value="사진 출처"/><%@ include file="image-credit-links.jspf" %><br>화면 표시: 원본 비율 유지·전체 이미지 표시</p></c:if></div><%@ include file="card-close.jspf" %></details></article>
